# 懵然不知
(pos:形容詞)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道，一啲都唔知情
eng:completely unaware; totally ignorant of something
<eg>
yue:佢對呢件事懵然不知，仲以為一切正常。 (keoi5 deoi3 ni1 gin6 si6 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1, zung6 ji5 wai6 jat1 cit3 zing3 soeng4.)
eng:He is completely unaware of this matter and still thinks everything is normal.
</eg>
</explanation> [end of text]


